{
  "_comment": "Vetted npm packages that vendored components may depend on. Anything not listed makes a component ineligible: nothing is installed on the strength of upstream metadata. Ranges are the ranges to request; the build validator freezes the resolved exact versions afterwards. 'family' is used to prevent two libraries doing the same job (e.g. two animation engines).",
